data: {"done":true,"ok":true,"sessionId":"cmvpgzakd0023tpw2hbe4v9e1","assistantMessageId":"cmvpgzuil0041tpw25amuh8oi","content":"I'll add a reset button next to the counter that sets the count back to 10. Here are the updated files:\n\n```html path=index.html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Counter App</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>Counter</h1>\n    <div id=\"counter\">10</div>\n    <div class=\"button-container\">\n        <button id=\"incrementBtn\">Clicked 0 times</button>\n        <button id=\"resetBtn\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">BEAN Counter — gold on black, always counting.</p>\n    <script src=\"utils.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n```javascript path=app.js\n// Get the counter element and buttons from the DOM\nconst counterElement = document.getElementById('counter');\nconst incrementBtn = document.getElementById('incrementBtn');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetBtn');\n\n// Initialize counter\nlet counter = 10;\n\n// Update the counter display\nfunction updateCounter() {\n    counterElement.textContent = counter;\n    incrementBtn.textContent = `Clicked ${counter} times`;\n}\n\n// Add click event listener to the increment button\nincrementBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    counter++;\n    updateCounter();\n});\n\n// Add click event listener to the reset button\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    counter = 10;\n    updateCounter();\n});\n\n// Initialize the display\nupdateCounter();\n```\n\n```css path=styles.css\nbody {\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 100vh;\n    margin: 0;\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n\nh1 {\n    color: black;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n#counter {\n    font-size: 48px;\n    color: gold;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.button-container {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n    background-color: black;\n    color: gold;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n    background-color: gold;\n    color: black;\n}\n\n.tagline {\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    color: black;\n    font-style: italic;\n}\n```","fileChanges":[],"rejected":[],"files":[{"path":"app.js","content":"// Get the counter element and buttons from the DOM\nconst counterElement = document.getElementById('counter');\nconst incrementBtn = document.getElementById('incrementBtn');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetBtn');\n\n// Initialize counter\nlet counter = 10;\n\n// Update the counter display\nfunction updateCounter() {\n    counterElement.textContent = counter;\n    incrementBtn.textContent = `Clicked ${counter} times`;\n}\n\n// Add click event listener to the increment button\nincrementBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    counter++;\n    updateCounter();\n});\n\n// Add click event listener to the reset button\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    counter = 10;\n    updateCounter();\n});\n\n// Initialize the display\nupdateCounter();\n","previousContent":"// Get the counter element and button from the DOM\nconst counterElement = document.getElementById('counter');\nconst incrementBtn = document.getElementById('incrementBtn');\n\n// Initialize counter\nlet counter = 10;\n\n// Update the counter display\nfunction updateCounter() {\n    counterElement.textContent = counter;\n    incrementBtn.textContent = `Clicked ${counter} times`;\n}\n\n// Add click event listener to the button\nincrementBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    counter++;\n    updateCounter();\n});\n","status":"modified","version":3,"updatedAt":"2026-10-26T16:27:37.485Z"},{"path":"index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Counter App</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>Counter</h1>\n    <div id=\"counter\">10</div>\n    <div class=\"button-container\">\n        <button id=\"incrementBtn\">Clicked 0 times</button>\n        <button id=\"resetBtn\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">BEAN Counter — gold on black, always counting.</p>\n    <script src=\"utils.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","previousContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Counter App</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>Counter</h1>\n    <div id=\"counter\">0</div>\n    <button id=\"incrementBtn\">Increment</button>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">BEAN Counter — gold on black, always counting.</p>\n    <script src=\"utils.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","status":"modified","version":3,"updatedAt":"2026-10-26T16:27:37.482Z"},{"path":"styles.css","content":"body {\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 100vh;\n    margin: 0;\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n\nh1 {\n    color: black;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n#counter {\n    font-size: 48px;\n    color: gold;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.button-container {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n    background-color: black;\n    color: gold;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n    background-color: gold;\n    color: black;\n}\n\n.tagline {\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    color: black;\n    font-style: italic;\n}\n","previousContent":"body {\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 100vh;\n    margin: 0;\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n\nh1 {\n    color: black;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n#counter {\n    font-size: 48px;\n    color: gold;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n    background-color: black;\n    color: gold;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n    background-color: gold;\n    color: black;\n}\n\n.tagline {\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    color: black;\n    font-style: italic;\n}\n","status":"modified","version":3,"updatedAt":"2026-10-26T16:27:37.484Z"},{"path":"utils.js","content":"function add(a, b) {\n    return a + b;\n}\n\n// Export the function for use in other modules\nif (typeof module !== 'undefined' && module.exports) {\n    module.exports = { add };\n}\n","previousContent":null,"status":"generated","version":1,"updatedAt":"2026-10-26T16:27:24.177Z"},{"path":"utils.test.js","content":"// Import the add function\nconst { add } = require('./utils.js');\n\n// Test the add function\nif (add(2, 3) === 5) {\n    console.log('PASS');\n} else {\n    console.log('FAIL');\n}\n","previousContent":null,"status":"generated","version":1,"updatedAt":"2026-10-26T16:27:24.179Z"}],"durationMs":5714,"meta":{"failed":false,"failureMessage":null,"fileChanges":[],"rejected":[]}}

